   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "This Block designs that theme's place on the ladder: The\nmethod (13 methods in 3 families, the six steps) is the theme's\nown:\nplugins/haipipe-toolkit/servers/workbench-design/guide/method.\nmd.",
